  "notes": "Historical material/card import retained as provenance; the inherited hkl/d/intensity array is superseded and preserved privately with its full original document. The present peaks are independent kinematic X-ray calculations (0.8-20 A, sum multiplicity*|F|^2, maximum 100), not measured intensities or a recovered source-card selection. COD 9010029 Angel et al. (1989), including reported Mg/Si occupational disorder. Calculate in the CIF native origin using its explicit symmetry operations. Existing EOSMAT sites use an equivalent x+1/2 origin. Reference cell retained. Original scientific EOS evidence, observations and applicability limits are unchanged.",
